{"ID":"20240118151336-ojzm2dx","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151336-ojzm2dx","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151336-ojzm2dx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151336-nb6xzw7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122082256-i3sg879\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122082242-8w5p538\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:30,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:44\u0026#125;","title":"057蒺藜子","type":"doc","updated":"20240129095531"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151336-nb6xzw7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151336-nb6xzw7","updated":"20240122082220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦温，主恶血，破症结积聚，喉痹乳难，久服长肌肉，明目轻身。又名刺疾藜。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122082225-brxel12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122082225-brxel12"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】到处皆有。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122082227-9ygfpjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122082227-9ygfpjq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦性温。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122082228-skttwlm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122082228-skttwlm"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】主身体风痿，头痛，咳逆伤肺，肺痿，止烦下气，小儿头疮，痈肿阴溃，可做磨粉。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122082230-utkeu5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122082230-utkeu5m"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】主身益精，疗水脏冷，小便多，止遗沥泄精，溺血肿痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122082232-bowtu43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122082232-bowtu43"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【毅民】白疾藜治睛球凹陷，及睛生障翳，视物模糊。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122082233-wniyaki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122082233-wniyaki"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】利湿，此以金行水也。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122082235-q4npu92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122082235-q4npu92"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【时方】腰脊引痛——捣末为蜜丸，胡豆大，酒服二丸日三。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122082240-xm5yd1y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122082240-xm5yd1y"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"年久失明——阴干捣散，食后水服方寸匕。（外台）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122082221-yfw78l0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122082221-yfw78l0"}},{"ID":"20240122082242-0l4lf8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122082242-0l4lf8x"}},{"ID":"20240122082242-bm084cv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122082242-bm084cv","updated":"20240129095423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第57味药蒺藜子。蒺藜子这个药呢？是眼科的要药，尤其呢蒺藜子里面有一种，是白蒺藜，白蒺藜打粉，老师，这个病人一个眼球都萎缩掉了，凹下去了，怎么办啊？蒺藜，蒺藜它能够金生水，金能够生水，那个眼珠里面本来就很多水在里面，金生水。用白色的最好，白色是金嘛，蒺藜有一种黑的和白的，那本身蒺藜味是苦，而且性是温的，一般来说，这个蒺藜很普遍，到处都有，那一般来说身体的这个风痒啊，肺家的病里面会用，还有眼科用。"}]},{"ID":"20240122082242-8w5p538","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122082242-8w5p538","updated":"20240129095509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你看那个【毅民】，毅民就是崔毅民，也是一个经方家，那白蒺藜治睛球凹陷，睛生障翳，视物模糊。过去崔毅民是蛮有名的中医的眼科。那【唐容川】说，它能够利湿，为什么？此以金行水。那后面呢，诸位看，他说年久失明，现在时方，眼睛长年失明的，你把蒺藜阴干捣散吃，都可以。那我临床上面开处方的时候，诸位看，本经的原文：蒺藜之它恶血，破症，那个症结积聚，喉箅还有乳难。"}]},{"ID":"20240122082256-i3sg879","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122082256-i3sg879","updated":"20240129095531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我在临床上的时候，乳房有硬块，还有哺乳，里面有硬块，，那个奶水没有办法完全排完，还有呢，这个妇科的，子宫里面的肌瘤，都可以使用到蒺藜。而眼科的时候是蒺藜里面的白蒺藜，专门是治疗眼科的，这个药用的很多。"}]}]}